{99}{[It's power supply reactivated, the generator comes back online at your command. You hear the Lift command console whirr to life.]}{[It's power supply reactivated, the generator comes back online at your command. You hear the Lift command console whirr to life.]}{}{}{}{gf2 1}
{100}{[The generator is in emergency powersave mode. The display indicates that a blown circuit breaker in the Sub Tunnels is at fault. You'll need to find the Circuit Controller box to restore power to the generator.]}{[The generator is in emergency powersave mode. The display indicates that a blown circuit breaker in the Sub Tunnels is at fault. You'll need to find the Circuit Controller box to restore power to the generator.]}{}{}{}{}
{101}{[The generator is operating, and the Lift Console appears to be functional.]}{[The generator is operating, and the Lift Console appears to be functional.]}{}{}{}{}
